Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, yesterday in
my Arrow review I asked you all to submit

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:12.590
questions so I picked 10 of them to answer
with one bonus question.

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:15.210
We also got official news about Grant Gustin’s
Flash tv show.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.810
So i’ll talk about that first before we
do questions.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:20.650
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do Arrow videos every week.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:26.420
Because the new Flash show is basically a
spinoff I’m going to be doing weekly videos

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.420
for that too.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.420
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:33.160
I’ll probably combine Q&amp;As for both of those
since they exist in a shared Universe.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.120
Like they’re going to cross over.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:38.339
So big news today, The CW officially picked
up The Flash.

00:00:38.339 --> 00:00:41.070
Which means it will start airing episodes
in the Fall.

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:43.410
In addition, the first trailer is supposed
to air during the Arrow Finale.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:47.980
That’s what my bonus video will be next
Wednesday.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:50.250
So I’ll do that separately from my review
of the Arrow Finale.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.719
They’re also probably going to use that
Trailer to announce which day the show will

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:54.719
air.

00:00:54.719 --> 00:00:58.079
I would guess that it’s either going to
air back to back with Arrow Season 3 on the

00:00:58.079 --> 00:00:59.079
same night.

00:00:59.079 --> 00:01:00.079
Like right after Arrow to benefit from that
audience.

00:01:00.079 --> 00:01:01.079
Once Arrow goes off the Air I’ll just alternate
between Arrow and Flash bonus videos every

00:01:01.079 --> 00:01:02.079
week.

00:01:02.079 --> 00:01:04.100
I’m also expecting them to air the pilot
episode at Comic Con, if that happens I’ll

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:31.160
be sure to post a non-spoilery review.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:35.320
On to Questions, careful for spoilers from
the episode if you haven’t seen it yet.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.360
Here we go.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:41.250
Question 1 - Delaneyel asks do you think they
will ever start calling Oliver "Green Arrow"

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.160
instead of just "Arrow"?﻿

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.550
No I don’t think the show is going to use
the Green part.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:49.110
There’s definitely been an evolution of
his identity since season 1.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:52.260
He started out as the vigilante and then became
the Arrow.

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:55.211
Remember when Quentin was talking to his Sergeant
in the episode.

00:01:55.211 --> 00:01:59.930
The Sergeant called Oliver the Vigilante and
Quentin corrected him by saying, The Arrow.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:04.110
I think more people will just start thing
of him less as a vigilante and more as a force

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:05.160
for good.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:09.619
But even Batman was never percieved as a 100
percent good guy.

00:02:09.619 --> 00:02:13.810
The beauty of being the Arrow is that Oliver
can walk the line of justice more than the

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:14.810
police.

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:21.310
So he’ll never be like Superman who Batman
calls “The Boy Scout”.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:25.769
Question 2 - Sapphire Blue (no avatar) asks
What do you think about photo from next episode

00:02:25.769 --> 00:02:28.200
where Slade is taking Felicity hostage?﻿

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:33.849
It’s a nice teaser for him killing the one
Oliver loves most, but if you remember the

00:02:33.849 --> 00:02:36.599
love algebra I did in my review.

00:02:36.599 --> 00:02:38.040
He loves all the women equally.

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.590
So by default there would be no one woman
he would love the most.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.420
So I think something else is going on in that
scene.

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:46.730
I mean, Slade is probably going to kill a
bunch of people anyway, so Felicity probably

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:49.849
just gets snagged in the crossfire.

00:02:49.849 --> 00:02:53.389
There were some behind the scenes images they
shot at a water treatment facility with a

00:02:53.389 --> 00:02:54.389
bunch of pipes.

00:02:54.389 --> 00:02:56.639
So I’m guessing that’s where that scene
takes place.

00:02:56.639 --> 00:02:59.909
But I have no idea what the location is doubling
for.

00:02:59.909 --> 00:03:01.359
Some sort of power plant maybe.

00:03:01.359 --> 00:03:05.209
Felicity’s already confirmed for Season
3, so we know she’ll get out of that situation

00:03:05.209 --> 00:03:06.209
some how.

00:03:06.209 --> 00:03:10.620
The list of people that actually have real
chance of dying is pretty small.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:14.989
Question 3 - David Alvarado asks Do you think
that similar to Quentin being promoted to

00:03:14.989 --> 00:03:18.079
Commissioner, that Laurel could be DA next
season since Kate Spencer was killed?﻿

00:03:18.079 --> 00:03:23.389
I don’t think Quentin will be commissioner,
but I do think that Laurel could be District

00:03:23.389 --> 00:03:24.389
Attorney.

00:03:24.389 --> 00:03:29.090
There’s a lot of Black Canary, Sara dying
talk going on, but even if Laurel does become

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:30.719
Black Canary in season 3.

00:03:30.719 --> 00:03:33.959
It’s going to take all season for her to
get there.

00:03:33.959 --> 00:03:39.760
She’s not just going to show up in episode
1 in black leather.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:45.730
I think we’ll just see her working in a
position of power where she can help prosecute

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:49.299
the criminals Team Arrow takes down.

00:03:49.299 --> 00:03:54.540
Plus with Quentin back to detective status
he has a lot more freedom to help them out

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:55.540
too.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:56.540
Team Arrow will just become more effective.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:00.870
Question 4 - Kim asks Do you think there is
a possibility that Merlyn helps out team Arrow?

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:03.689
He’s actually standing next to them in the
trailer.

00:04:03.689 --> 00:04:05.069
So definitely.

00:04:05.069 --> 00:04:09.309
Oliver still has a lot of unfinished business
with him and Thea still doesn’t like him.

00:04:09.309 --> 00:04:11.859
So I don’t think Merlyn will be a good guy
from now on.

00:04:11.859 --> 00:04:15.349
He’ll just have a temporary truce while
they deal with the shit storm.

00:04:15.349 --> 00:04:19.500
There’s a lot of rumors that he could also
be the big villain in Season 3.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.630
Or be the big villain again.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:24.479
Sins of the father was something Isabel talked
about when she revealed her plan to Oliver.

00:04:24.479 --> 00:04:26.150
So I like the idea of Thea’s father, Merlyn
and Felicity’s Father, who we haven’t

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:27.150
met.

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:28.150
Turning out to be the villains of Season 3.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:31.330
The thing about all the different plot threads
going each season is that they all have to

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.110
connect by the finale.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:38.300
For instance, the one common denominator this
season is Oliver and Slade’s relationship.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:43.539
So in Season 3 I really like the idea of Felicity’s
relationship with her Father or Thea’s being

00:04:43.539 --> 00:04:45.270
the common denominator.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:46.270
And don’t forget.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:49.190
Oliver has a son, so sins of the father has
a whole new meaning now.

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:50.190
That relationship will be a big plot point
in season 3 too.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.190
Fathers and Sons, Fathers and daughters.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:59.570
It would work out a lot better if Oliver had
a daughter.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:03.289
Which is funny, because in real life Stephen
Amell has a daughter.

00:05:03.289 --> 00:05:08.570
Question 5 - Marvel DC asks How do you think
roy will react after he wakes up?

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:13.129
He’ll probably be horrified at what he’s
done to everyone and to Thea.

00:05:13.129 --> 00:05:18.669
I think he’ll spend season 3 trying to repair
that relationship and atone for his crimes

00:05:18.669 --> 00:05:20.000
against the city.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.960
Those demons will be what motivates him to
be a hero.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:26.949
And yes, I do think he won’t have super
strength or healing anymore.

00:05:26.949 --> 00:05:28.710
He’ll be back to normal.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:31.080
Oliver is the benchmark for hero on the show.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:36.580
He’s a totally normal person with no super
powers and he still does the work of a hero

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.009
just like the other Justice League members.

00:05:39.009 --> 00:05:43.180
Same deal with Batman, it’s doing what they
do without superpowers that makes them heroes.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:46.039
So Roy is just going to ride that train going
forward.

00:05:46.039 --> 00:05:49.870
Question 6 - Jose asks Do you think Oliver
should take the mirikuro?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.690
No, I actually just explained it in that last
question.

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:58.100
But let’s talk about the consequences if
he did take it.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.689
No one so far has been immune to the mental
side effects.

00:06:00.689 --> 00:06:03.509
So if Oliver took it he’d succumb to the
madness too.

00:06:03.509 --> 00:06:06.479
He’d probably hallucinate his father.

00:06:06.479 --> 00:06:09.560
He actually spent most of season 1 on the
island hallucinating him.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:14.319
He’d flip out and turn into the Frank Castle
Punisher and just start murdering supervillains

00:06:14.319 --> 00:06:17.379
and Amanda Waller would have to nuke Starling
City all over again.

00:06:17.379 --> 00:06:20.099
Slade and Oliver are essentially the same
person.

00:06:20.099 --> 00:06:23.199
Slade went to the dark side and Oliver became
Luke Skywalker.

00:06:23.199 --> 00:06:30.630
I’m still waiting to see if he’s able
to redeem Darth Slade.

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:35.260
Question 7 - The Sedinam (no avatar) asks
They keep destroying the city each season,

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:39.210
did they even fully rebuild it after the undertaking?

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:42.060
Good point, no they never fully rebuilt the
Glades.

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.169
That was where the blast went off.

00:06:44.169 --> 00:06:48.379
It got worse and that’s what Brother Blood
built his campaign for mayor on.

00:06:48.379 --> 00:06:52.550
He was like this is a problem no one cares
about but me, I’ll fix this city.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.910
So the city itself is still broken.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:59.219
Now they’re breaking it again, even if they
don’t nuke it.

00:06:59.219 --> 00:07:01.729
Slade’s army has trashed it.

00:07:01.729 --> 00:07:04.300
So I expect Queen Industries to be a big part
of healing it between the finale and the season

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.300
3 finale.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:06.300
I don’t think it will be fixed when season
3 starts.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:07.300
I think Oliver will become a much more active
participant in making the city better with

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.300
his company.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.159
The big question is how he’s going to get
his company back.

00:07:10.159 --> 00:07:12.819
I’m really interested to see how they deal
with that plot point.

00:07:12.819 --> 00:07:17.620
Question 8 - Sam Hockney asks Do you think
Thea will learn Oliver's identity?

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.280
Yes I hope so.

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:23.660
If she knows all about Merlyn she’s halfway
there already.

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:28.130
She started to question the connection between
Slade and Oliver so I’m hoping he does the

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.310
same thing he did with Roy.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:33.350
Where he ripped his mask off and made this
really passionate speech.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:38.099
Merlyn is going to stay with Thea, and if
Merlyn is marching with them in the trailer

00:07:38.099 --> 00:07:40.270
it means they all have to meetup at some point.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.639
I’m really looking forward to that reunion.

00:07:42.639 --> 00:07:45.699
Oliver still doesn’t know Merlyn is alive.

00:07:45.699 --> 00:07:50.699
Question 9 - MTA Critic asks What other kinds
of trick arrows do you think Oliver would

00:07:50.699 --> 00:07:51.819
use in the future?﻿

00:07:51.819 --> 00:07:56.540
I think they’ll actually attach the mirakuru
cure to oliver and merlyn’s arrows.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:59.789
I guess you could call mirakuru cure tipped
arrows trick arrows.

00:07:59.789 --> 00:08:02.419
I think you’re asking about regular trick
arrows though.

00:08:02.419 --> 00:08:06.199
Realistically he could use EMP arrows like
Hawkeye did in Avengers.

00:08:06.199 --> 00:08:10.499
Stephen Amell said he really wants more trick
arrows too, so don’t be surprised if there

00:08:10.499 --> 00:08:16.569
are a few new ones next season.

00:08:16.569 --> 00:08:20.819
Question 10 - Geesma asks Do you think they’ll
change Oliver’s Costume or his look in season

00:08:20.819 --> 00:08:22.229
3?

00:08:22.229 --> 00:08:23.969
Not really, not in a significant way.

00:08:23.969 --> 00:08:26.379
Usually the lead actor is the one that changes
the least.

00:08:26.379 --> 00:08:29.979
They’re like the throughline for the whole
series so for the most part, they need to

00:08:29.979 --> 00:08:31.099
change the least.

00:08:31.099 --> 00:08:33.300
At least from a physical standpoint.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:39.710
And if Oliver changes his leather pants, Felicity
won’t be able to make jokes about them anymore.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:45.050
Bonus Question - KJ Bucane asks What DC Superhero
do you want to see get a tv show next?

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.769
Gosh, they have so many in development.

00:08:46.769 --> 00:08:47.769
In terms of actual shows.

00:08:47.769 --> 00:08:50.260
I think Suicide Squad would be next.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:52.940
But if I had to pick a single superhero it
would have to be either Deathstroke, Vandal

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.730
Savage or Nyssa Al Ghul.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:56.230
It would have to be a villain.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:09:00.680
We’ve seen so many new hero shows, now it’s
time to see a villain get their own show.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:05.010
If it were Vandal Savage it could be like
an Injustice Society Show and if it were Nyssa

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:07.760
Al Ghul it could be like a League of Assassin’s
Show.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:12.420
It’s much more likely to get a show based
on a character that’s already been established

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.860
on Arrow or another show.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.190
But thanks so much for submitting questions,
these are always a ton of fun to do.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:22.930
And remember, be on the lookout for a special
cameo in the finale and a trailer for The

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:23.930
Flash.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:24.930
If we do get a trailer.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:25.930
I’ll make it my bonus video.

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.910
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:31.560
Right now click here for my review of the
episode and click here to learn all about

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.060
my new bonus channel.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:35.050
That’s right bonus gaming channel.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:37.779
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:09:37.779 --> 00:09:38.670
High Fives!

